    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST NOW</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825550/extras/80de3fadeb4822b8d88d8ca08900cf72.avif?t=1691766977\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825550/extras/151f1e853aa51420f19aa37161a08d98.avif?t=1691766977\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825550/extras/1ba51ce4adc0e9ec5a8350547ba8588c.avif?t=1691766977\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825550/extras/377b5b51cfe855c1fcd7f989b0ce2394.avif?t=1691766977\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1825550/extras/02992dfe8ab439d0b3ff696aca7b2805.avif?t=1691766977\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>A story-driven psychological thriller about the horrific consequences of a loved one's suicide.<br><br>After the tragedy of his wife's suicide, an office worker must process the horrific events surrounding the incident. Experience haunting characterizations of five stages of grief \u2013 denial, anger, bargaining, depression and finally acceptance in this atmospheric 2D psychological thriller. The story focuses on the social issue of suicide and explores relationships with people who are at risk. <br><br>Features<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Story-driven psychological thriller<br></li><li>Focus on suicide and people at risk<br></li><li>Immersive story and detailed characters.<br></li><li>Original graphics and soundtrack.</li></ul>",
